==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|tveir|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|twai|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{recons|dwóh₁|lang=ine-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/tʰveiːr/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|eiːr|lang=is}}

===Numeral===
{{head|is|numeral}}

# [[two]]; the cardinal number after [[einn#Icelandic|einn]] and before [[þrír#Icelandic|þrír]].

